      "title": "Häny HRW 2000",
      "h1": "Häny HRW 2000",
      "description": "Agitator HRW 2000. Agitators ensure continuous operation by holding and homogenizing the mixed suspension and removing any air bubbles by means of a slowly rotating paddle. Optional level sensors enab",
